---
// Pain Points Section
---

<section id="dolor" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute left-12 top-10 h-44 w-44 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]/8 blur-2xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-bg-light)]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-bg-light)]/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--color-primary)]">
        ¿Te identificas?
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dark)] sm:text-4xl">
        Dile adiós a la inseguridad que te frena.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Reconocer tu dolor es el primer paso. Transforma cada situación en una oportunidad de cambio con acompañamiento empático y protocolos que ya ayudaron a cientos de pacientes como tú.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"
      role="list"
      aria-label="Situaciones comunes que resolvemos a diario"
    >
      {[
        {
          icon: (
            <svg class="h-7 w-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 20c4.418 0 8-3.134 8-7s-3.582-7-8-7-8 3.134-8 7c0 2.737 1.845 5.11 4.584 6.255L8 21l3.004-1.719A9.38 9.38 0 0 0 12 20Z" />
              <path d="M9.5 10.5h.01" />
              <path d="M14.5 10.5h.01" />
              <path d="M9.75 14c.6.8 1.57 1.3 2.25 1.3s1.65-.5 2.25-1.3" />
            </svg>
          ),
          title: 'Te tapas la boca al reír',
          description:
            'Escondes tu risa para que nadie note imperfecciones. Recupera la libertad de reír sin filtros con un diseño que respeta tu esencia.',
        },
        {
          icon: (
            <svg class="h-7 w-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" />
              <path d="M17 7h.01" />
            </svg>
          ),
          title: 'Evitas fotos de cerca',
          description:
            'Prefieres quedarte al margen o pides edición. Creamos un plan que integra estética y salud para que quieras guardar cada recuerdo.',
        },
        {
          icon: (
            <svg class="h-7 w-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M17 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1" />
              <path d="M7 8H6a4 4 0 0 0 0 8h1" />
              <path d="M8 8v8" />
              <path d="M16 8v8" />
              <path d="M9 12h6" />
            </svg>
          ),
          title: 'Temes al juicio social',
          description:
            'Las malas experiencias te frenan. Con protocolos sin dolor, tiempos explicados y acompañamiento 1 a 1, sentirás que cada decisión es tuya.',
        },
      ].map((item, index) => (
        <article
          key={item.title}
          role="listitem"
          class="group relative flex h-full flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[var(--color-primary)]/12 bg-white/95 p-8 shadow-[0_22px_55px_-40px_rgba(15,30,32,0.3)] transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5"
          data-aos="fade-up"
          data-aos-delay={`${index * 120 + 100}`}
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]/12">
              {item.icon}
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--color-primary)]">Dolor frecuente</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-dark)]">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{item.description}</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="#promesa"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]"
          >
            Ver cómo lo resolvemos
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 10h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <path d="M10 5l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-12 top-1/2 hidden h-32 w-32 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]/10 blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-70 md:block"></div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
